    {
      "case_id": "capability-probe-unavailable",
      "purpose": "An environment marking capability probing for the preferred route's model with an explicit false rather than an absent key, and recording no exact-invocation outcome for it at all. This is where the frozen runtime-capability programme's undetermined observation lands.",
      "proves": "Probe unavailability rejects the route, and probe absence is never read as probe success — an observation from which no availability claim derives is at least as weak as an absent probe, so treating it as selectable would be the substitution the requirement forbids. The absent exact-invocation outcome is not itself a probe failure, so exactly one diagnostic is emitted.",
